<title>ITALY: Italy's Amga share offer closes oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Italy's Amga share offer closes oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The offer for the 151 million shares in Genoa gas and water supplier Amga has closed about four times oversubscribed, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>In the public offer, there was demand for 175 million shares out of 60 million shares on offer, while in the private placement directed by Mediobanca and Paribas with institutions there were offers for 395 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
